WEBVTT

00:02:59.163 --> 00:03:00.897
So the eternal question:

00:03:00.930 --> 00:03:02.063
What is an NFT?

00:03:02.830 --> 00:03:04.230
Simply put,

00:03:04.230 --> 00:03:06.230
it is a permanent tracking device

00:03:06.263 --> 00:03:08.930
that proves ownership of a digital file,

00:03:10.397 --> 00:03:12.830
somewhat similar to the way
that you can chip a pet

00:03:12.863 --> 00:03:15.797
to identify it as yours if it runs away,

00:03:15.830 --> 00:03:20.730
an NFT is a cryptographic token
connected to a digital asset

00:03:20.763 --> 00:03:24.230
to preserve ownership rights
in the metaverse.

00:03:25.763 --> 00:03:28.330
Non-fungible means "not exchangeable."

00:03:28.363 --> 00:03:31.897
Most things in the real world
are non-fungible,